{
  "id": "haptic",
  "term": "haptic",
  "definition": "Haptic refers to perception and experience through bodily contact and movement, such as sensing pressure, friction, vibration, temperature change, and guidance from the body’s interaction with the environment, other people, or technology. It goes beyond simple touch sensation by involving how contact helps a person detect, interpret, and regulate action.",
